
[l_english.DECISION_C12_APPLE_FAMILY_JOINT_MILITARY_EXERCISE]
Apple Pie Family Joint Military Exercise

[l_english.DECISION_C12_APPLE_FAMILY_JOINT_MILITARY_EXERCISE_desc]
We will extend our cooperation into the military sphere, seeking to establish a unified military framework so the two nations’ armed forces can build mutual understanding and confidence — thereby laying the groundwork for an eventual merger of command.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_APPLE_FAMILY_JOINT_MILITARY_EXERCISE]
苹果派家族联合军事演习

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_APPLE_FAMILY_JOINT_MILITARY_EXERCISE_desc]
我们将彼此之间的合作扩展到军事上，尝试建立一个统一的军事体系架构，方便俩国的军队建立彼此的了解和信心，从而为最终指挥权上的合并奠定基础。
